[00:00.00]Should auld acquaintance be forgot,
[00:04.00]And never brought to mind?
[00:08.00]Should auld acquaintance be forgot,
[00:12.00]And days o' auld lang syne?
[00:16.00]For auld lang syne, my dear,
[00:20.00]For auld lang syne,
[00:24.00]We'll tak a cup o' kindness yet,
[00:28.00]For auld lang syne.
[00:32.00]And there's a hand, my trusty fiere!
[00:36.00]And gie's a hand o' thine!
[00:40.00]We'll tak a cup o' kindness yet,
[00:44.00]For auld lang syne.